/*
 * Pose Channel Dashboard (`channeldashboard.html`).
 *
 * Carried over from the legacy page stylesheet and scoped under `.channel-dash`
 * so its generic hooks (`.page`, `.btn`, `.tab-item`, `.modal` …) cannot leak
 * into other routes. Ids are kept because the ported logic still addresses them
 * by id, exactly as the legacy script did.
 *
 * Two legacy quirks are resolved here: the `:root` token block now lives on the
 * wrapper, and the `body` rules (font, background, 100vh) moved onto the wrapper
 * as well. `dashboard.css` is generated — see `.port-tmp/README.md`.
 */
